    "soru": "<p>Aşağıda öncelik diyagramı ve görev süreleri verilen montaj hattı dengeleme problemi için, <b>tek modelli U tipi hat dengeleme</b> probleminin matematiksel modelini <b>açık formda</b> yazınız. Çevrim zamanını 10 zaman birimi alınız.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 246 114\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:246px;height:auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Öncelik diyagramı\"><defs><marker id=\"m8\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"44.0\" y1=\"34.0\" x2=\"77.0\" y2=\"34.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m8)\"/><line x1=\"41.2\" y1=\"42.3\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"71.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m8)\"/><line x1=\"105.8\" y1=\"36.6\" x2=\"201.3\" y2=\"54.3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m8)\"/><line x1=\"106.0\" y1=\"80.0\" x2=\"139.0\" y2=\"80.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m8)\"/><line x1=\"167.1\" y1=\"75.1\" x2=\"201.9\" y2=\"62.2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#m8)\"/><circle cx=\"30.0\" cy=\"34.0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"38.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"19.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\">3</text><circle cx=\"92.0\" cy=\"34.0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"92.0\" y=\"38.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"104.0\" y=\"19.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\">6</text><circle cx=\"92.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"92.0\" y=\"84.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"104.0\" y=\"65.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\">4</text><circle cx=\"154.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"154.0\" y=\"84.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"166.0\" y=\"65.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\">5</text><circle cx=\"216.0\" cy=\"57.0\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"216.0\" y=\"61.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"228.0\" y=\"42.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\">1</text></svg><p style=\"font-size:.85em\">Dairelerin içindeki sayı görev numarasıdır; dairenin yanındaki küçük sayı görev süresidir. Oklar öncelik ilişkilerini gösterir.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Görev</th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Görev süresi</th><td>3</td><td>6</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Komşu öncül(ler)</th><td>–</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>2, 4</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Ayrıca aşağıdaki değerleri giriniz (m<sub>max</sub> = m<sub>min</sub> + 1 alınız).</p>",
